<title>PHILIPPINES: ABS-CBN plans one bln pesos worth of debt.</title>
<headline>ABS-CBN plans one bln pesos worth of debt.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABS-CBN Broadcasting Corp ABS.Ps said on Tuesday it is planning to issue one billion peso worth of long-term commercial paper to finance the company's expansion program.</p>
<p>ABS-CBN president Eugenio Lopez III told reporters the issue will carry an interest rate of 50 basis points over the 90-day Philippine Treasury bill and will mature in seven years.</p>
<p>Lopez said an underwriting agreement was signed with Banco Santander.</p>
</text>
